es**, exactly as we did for Kenya, Tanzania, Uganda, Rwanda and Burundi. Not just nine.\\n\\nBelow is the complete set of 60, with a separate photographic search for every destination. Save each verified photograph using the filename shown, in `public/images/attractions/drc/`\\\\. The images are search references, not yet verified local WebP files.\\n\\n## 1\\\\. Wildlife \u0026amp; Safari — National Parks and Reserves\\n\\nimage_group{\\\"query\\\":[\\\"Virunga National Park Congo mountain gorilla rainforest photography\\\"],\\\"aspect_ratio\\\":\\\"4:3\\\",\\\"layout\\\":\\\"carousel\\\",\\\"num_per_query\\\":1}\\n\\n**1\\\\. Virunga National Park**\\n\\n`virunga-national-park.webp`\\n\\nimage_group{\\\"query\\\":[\\\"Kahuzi Biega National Park Congo eastern lowland gorilla wildlife photography\\\"],\\\"aspect_ratio\\\":\\\"4:3\\\",\\\"layout\\\":\\\"carousel\\\",\\\"num_per_query\\\":1}\\n\\n**2\\\\. Kahuzi-Biega National Park**\\n\\n`kahuzi-biega-national-park.webp`\\n\\nimage_group{\\\"query\\\":[\\\"Garamba National Park DRC elephants savanna wildlife photography\\\"],\\\"aspect_ratio\\\":\\\"4:3\\\",\\\"layout\\\":\\\"carousel\\\",\\\"num_per_query\\\":1}\\n\\n**3\\\\. Garamba National Park**\\n\\n`garamba-national-park.webp`\\n\\nimage_group{\\\"query\\\":[\\\"Salonga National Park Congo tropical rainforest river landscape\\\"],\\\"aspect_ratio\\\":\\\"4:3\\\",\\\"layout\\\":\\\"carousel\\\",\\\"num_per_query\\\":1}\\n\\n**4\\\\. Salonga National Park**\\n\\n`salonga-national-park.webp`\\n\\nimage_group{\\\"query\\\":[\\\"Okapi Wildlife Reserve Ituri Congo okapi wildlife photograph\\\"],\\\"aspect_ratio\\\":\\\"4:3\\\",\\\"layout\\\":\\\"carousel\\\",\\\"num_per_query\\\":1}\\n\\n**5\\\\. Okapi Wildlife Reserve**\\n\\n`okapi-wildlife-reserve.webp`\\n\\nimage_group{\\\"query\\\":[\\\"Upemba National Park Democratic Republic Congo grassland lake wildlife\\\"],\\\"aspect_ratio\\\":\\\"4:3\\\",\\\"layout\\\":\\\"carousel\\\",\\\"num_per_query\\\